@startuml patch-manager-coffee-chat-alimtalk-template-event
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title PATCH /api/manager/v1/coffee-chat/alimtalk-template/{event}
caption CRB-78 · 알림톡 템플릿 수정. 알리고에 등록한 템플릿과 글자 하나까지 같아야 전송됨

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard" as Guard
participant "ParseEnumPipe\n+ ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "ManagerCoffeeChatController" as Controller
participant "ManagerCoffeeChatService" as Service
participant "AdminAlimtalkTemplateRepository" as Repository
participant "AdminAuditLogRepository" as AdminAuditLogRepository
participant "AlimtalkTemplateCache" as Cache
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: PATCH /api/manager/v1/coffee-chat/alimtalk-template/{event}\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>\n{ tpl_code?, title?, message?, button_name? }
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt event가 notification_event 값이 아님
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 Validation failed
else 필드가 문자열이 아님, trim 후 비었거나 길이 초과 (title 50 · message 1000 · button_name 14 · tpl_code 64), 보낸 필드가 하나도 없음
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (class-validator 메시지)
end
Pipe -> Controller: updateAlimtalkTemplate(event, req, manager)
Controller -> Service: updateAlimtalkTemplate(event, req, manager)
group transaction (DatabaseService.db.transaction)
  Service -> Repository: findByEventForUpdate(event, tx)
  Repository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT * FROM alimtalk_template WHERE event = ? FOR UPDATE
  PostgreSQL --> Repository: row (= before)
  Service -> Repository: update(event, fields, tx)
  Repository -> PostgreSQL: UPDATE alimtalk_template SET ..., updated_at = now() WHERE event = ? RETURNING
  PostgreSQL --> Repository: row (= after)
  Service -> AdminAuditLogRepository: insert({ adminEmail, action: "alimtalk_template.update", targetType: "alimtalk_template", targetId: event,\nbefore, after }, tx)
  AdminAuditLogRepository -> PostgreSQL: INSERT admin_audit_log
  note right of AdminAuditLogRepository: 변경과 같은 트랜잭션 (flow/admin-audit.puml). 기록이 실패하면 변경도 rollback
end
Service -> Cache: refresh()
ref over Service, PostgreSQL: 커밋 뒤 이 인스턴스 캐시를 다시 읽음 — flow/alimtalk-template-lookup.puml\n재조회 실패는 로그만 남기고 응답은 성공 (캐시는 최대 60초 TTL로 다시 읽음)
note over Service, PostgreSQL
  이 인스턴스는 다음 발송부터 바뀐 값을 쓰고, 다른 인스턴스는 캐시 TTL(60초) 안에 반영됨. 이미 접수된 건에는 영향 없음.
  알리고 쪽 템플릿은 어드민이 바꾸지 못함 (알리고 · 카카오에서 따로 수정 · 심사)
end note
Service --> Controller: AlimtalkTemplateDto
Controller --> Client: 200 { event, tpl_code, title, message, button_name, updated_at }

@enduml
